// expect: answers f = 7
// why: the subject's enum is the one its own file declares — a local variant that spells that
// why: enum's name is a different thing, and says nothing about which arms cover it
// from: packages/git/src/repo.wac, which has `RepoAt.Opened` and imports a function returning
